@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8010

### JSON service metadata
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Both recorded Rynek-Wawel routes and active reports
GET {{baseUrl}}/demo/scenario

### Reset before starting the presentation
POST {{baseUrl}}/demo/reset

### Baseline: Grodzka, 934.1 m and 747.4 s
POST {{baseUrl}}/demo/routes
Content-Type: application/json

{"mobility":"walking"}

### Simulate stairs at the fixed Grodzka obstacle
POST {{baseUrl}}/demo/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{"kind":"stairs","description":"Schody bez podjazdu — symulacja"}

### Wheelchair rules choose Planty; 20 minutes is insufficient (within_budget=false)
POST {{baseUrl}}/demo/routes
Content-Type: application/json

{"mobility":"wheelchair","duration_minutes":20}

### Walking ignores stairs; adding a road block changes both profiles
POST {{baseUrl}}/demo/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{"kind":"blocked_road","description":"Remont — symulacja"}

### List reports; copy an id to delete a single report
GET {{baseUrl}}/demo/reports

### Optional type filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/demo/reports?kind=stairs

### Replace the placeholder with an id from POST/GET reports (204, no body)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/demo/reports/REPORT_ID
